# Cursor AI context exclusions — monorepo (apps/, packages/, vendor/)
# Syntax: same as .gitignore (https://docs.cursor.com/context/ignore-files)

# --- Dependencies (large, generated) ---
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
.pnpm-store/

# --- Vendor IWXXM schema snapshots (read-only XSD/XML; use manifest + scripts) ---
# vendor/schemas/
# schemas/

# --- Build & bundle outputs ---
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
**/.vite/
**/.turbo/
**/.next/
**/.output/
**/.svelte-kit/

# --- Python caches & tooling ---
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytype/
**/.tox/
**/.nox/
**/.hypothesis/

# --- Test & coverage artifacts ---
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov/
**/htmlcov_ann/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/
**/.playwright/

# --- Git internals ---
.git/

# --- Secrets (also in .gitignore) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Legacy pre-migration trees (duplicate of target apps/ + packages/) ---
# Keep indexed until cutover if you need migration diffs; exclude to save context.
# GIFTs/
frontend/node_modules/
backend/.venv/

# --- Large or low-signal generated docs ---
docs/_build/
/site

# --- Local tooling ---
.tools/
.local/
